{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L1-0001", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "İngilizcede 'child' sözcüğünün çoğulu hangisidir?", "choices": {"A": "childs", "B": "children", "C": "childes", "D": "child"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "'child' has the irregular plural 'children'.", "tags": ["isim", "düzensiz-çoğul"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "public"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L1-0002", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "İngilizcede 'go' fiilinin geçmiş zaman (past simple) hâli hangisidir?", "choices": {"A": "goed", "B": "goes", "C": "went", "D": "gone"}, "answer": "C", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "'go' is irregular; its past simple is 'went'. ('gone' is the past participle.)", "tags": ["past-simple", "düzensiz-fiil"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L1-0003", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "İngilizcede 'an' belirteci (article) hangi durumda kullanılır?", "choices": {"A": "Sessiz sesle başlayan sözcüklerden önce", "B": "Ünlü sesle başlayan sözcüklerden önce", "C": "Yalnızca çoğullardan önce", "D": "Özel adlardan önce"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "'an' is used before words beginning with a vowel sound (an apple, an hour).", "tags": ["article", "a-an"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L2-0004", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "İngilizcede 'She ___ to school every day' cümlesinde boşluğa hangi biçim gelmelidir?", "choices": {"A": "go", "B": "goes", "C": "going", "D": "gone"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "In the present simple, third-person singular takes -s/-es: 'She goes'.", "tags": ["present-simple", "özne-fiil-uyumu"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L2-0005", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "İngilizcede present perfect (yakın geçmiş) zamanı hangi yardımcı fiille kurulur?", "choices": {"A": "do / does", "B": "have / has", "C": "will", "D": "was / were"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "The present perfect is formed with 'have/has + past participle'.", "tags": ["present-perfect", "yardımcı-fiil"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L2-0006", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "İngilizcede 'good' sıfatının üstünlük (comparative) derecesi hangisidir?", "choices": {"A": "gooder", "B": "more good", "C": "better", "D": "best"}, "answer": "C", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "'good' is irregular; its comparative is 'better' and superlative 'best'.", "tags": ["sıfat", "comparative"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L3-0007", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L3", "question": "İngilizcede 'If I ___ rich, I would travel the world' cümlesinde boşluğa dilbilgisel olarak hangi biçim gelir?", "choices": {"A": "am", "B": "was", "C": "were", "D": "will be"}, "answer": "C", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "The second conditional uses 'were' for all persons in the if-clause: 'If I were rich...'.", "tags": ["conditional", "subjunctive"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L3-0008", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L3", "question": "İngilizcede 'The list of items ___ on the desk' cümlesinde boşluğa hangi fiil gelmelidir?", "choices": {"A": "are", "B": "is", "C": "were", "D": "be"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "The subject is the singular 'list' (not 'items'), so the verb is singular: 'is'. The plural noun is a distractor.", "tags": ["özne-fiil-uyumu", "çeldirici-isim"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L4-0009", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L4", "question": "İngilizcede dolaylı anlatımda (reported speech) She said, 'I am tired.' cümlesi nasıl aktarılır? → She said that ___.", "choices": {"A": "she is tired", "B": "she was tired", "C": "she has been tired", "D": "I am tired"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "In reported speech the present 'am' shifts to the past 'was' and the pronoun to 'she': 'she was tired'.", "tags": ["reported-speech", "zaman-kaydırma"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-ENGRAM-TR-L4-0010", "language": "tr", "discipline": "İngilizce Dil Bilgisi", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L4", "question": "İngilizcede 'quickly' sözcüğü hangi tür bir sözcüktür (part of speech)?", "choices": {"A": "adjective (sıfat)", "B": "adverb (zarf)", "C": "noun (isim)", "D": "preposition (edat)"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "'quickly' modifies a verb and answers 'how', so it is an adverb.", "tags": ["sözcük-türü", "adverb"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
